# G9 Daily Bulletin Generation
# Runs every day at 7:00 AM KST (after US market close at 5:00 PM EST)
#
# Schedule explanation:
#   0 7 * * * = Every day at 7:00 AM
#
#   분 시 일 월 요일
#   │  │  │  │  │
#   │  │  │  │  └─── Day of week (0-7, 0=Sunday)
#   │  │  │  └────── Month (1-12)
#   │  │  └───────── Day of month (1-31)
#   │  └──────────── Hour (0-23)
#   └─────────────── Minute (0-59)
#
# Alternative schedules:
#   0 7 * * 1-5      = Weekdays only at 7:00 AM
#   0 17 * * *       = Every day at 5:00 PM
#   0 9,18 * * *     = Twice daily at 9:00 AM and 6:00 PM

0 7 * * * /Users/js/g9/regime_zero/run_daily_bulletin.sh >> /Users/js/g9/regime_zero/logs/cron.log 2>&1
